<body>
  <a class="skip-link" href="#explore">跳转到工作室导航</a>
  <main class="studio" id="studio">
    <header class="site-header">
      <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Xleia 主站">
        <span class="brand-symbol" aria-hidden="true">x</span>
        <span><span class="brand-name">Xleia <span>Studio</span></span><span class="brand-tag" style="display:block">A space for ideas</span></span>
      </a>
      <div class="header-right"><span class="night-label">夜间工作室</span><a class="header-link" href="/">回到主站<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10"/></svg></a></div>
    </header>

    <div class="stage-mobile" id="sceneStage">
      <div class="world" id="world">
        <img class="room" id="roomImage" src="/studio/visual/room.webp" width="1672" height="941" fetchpriority="high" alt="蓝色城市夜景映衬着中央工作台，左侧整墙书架亮着暖灯，右侧是实验台、布艺座椅与胡桃木茶几。" draggable="false">
        <canvas id="depthView" class="depth-canvas" aria-hidden="true" hidden></canvas>
        <button class="pin" style="left:50.8%;top:39.6%" data-zone="koto" aria-label="聚焦 KOTO 主显示器" aria-pressed="false"><span class="pin-orbit">01</span><span class="pin-label">KOTO · 主工作台</span></button>
        <button class="pin" style="left:12.4%;top:42.8%" data-zone="blog" aria-label="聚焦 Blog 文章书架" aria-pressed="false"><span class="pin-orbit">02</span><span class="pin-label">Blog · 文章书架</span></button>
        <button class="pin" style="left:82.8%;top:47.5%" data-zone="lab" aria-label="聚焦 Tech Lab 实验台" aria-pressed="false"><span class="pin-orbit">03</span><span class="pin-label">Tech Lab · 实验台</span></button>
        <button class="pin" style="left:88.4%;top:53.4%" data-zone="train" aria-label="聚焦 Train Libre 中文版" aria-pressed="false"><span class="pin-orbit">04</span><span class="pin-label">Train Libre · 训练与营养</span></button>
        <button class="pin" style="left:90.6%;top:74.5%" data-zone="about" aria-label="聚焦 About 私人角落" aria-pressed="false"><span class="pin-orbit">05</span><span class="pin-label">About / Now · 私人角落</span></button>
      </div>
      <div class="room-shadow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <p class="image-error" id="imageError" hidden>场景图暂时没有加载成功。你仍可通过下方导航阅读项目和文章。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="intro" id="intro"><p class="eyebrow"><b>AFTER HOURS</b> &nbsp; / &nbsp; XLEIA'S WORKSPACE</p><h1>夜间，继续创造。</h1><p class="intro-copy"><span>Explore. Create. Share.</span> 在一间工作室里，连接项目、技术与思考。</p></div>
    <p class="hint"><span></span>点击聚焦 · Esc 返回</p>
    <div class="room-controls">
      <button class="control" id="resetView" type="button"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 10a9 9 0 1 1 2 8M3 4v6h6"/></svg><span>重置视角</span></button>
      <button class="control" id="listToggle" type="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="listPanel"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="13" rx="2"/><path d="M8 21h8M12 17v4"/></svg><span id="listToggleLabel">2D 导航</span></button>
    </div>

    <section class="project-card" id="projectCard" aria-labelledby="cardTitle" hidden>
      <div class="card-topline"><span class="card-kicker" id="cardKicker"></span><button type="button" class="close-card" id="closeCard" aria-label="关闭项目介绍并返回全景"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 6 12 12M18 6 6 18"/></svg></button></div>
      <h2 class="card-title" id="cardTitle" tabindex="-1"></h2>
      <p class="card-copy" id="cardCopy"></p>
      <a class="card-link" id="cardLink" href="/projects/koto/"><span id="cardLinkLabel"></span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
    </section>

    <section class="list-panel" id="listPanel" aria-labelledby="listTitle" hidden>
      <div class="list-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE DIRECTORY</p><h2 id="listTitle" tabindex="-1">从这里，继续探索。</h2><p>你也可以直接选择想去的地方。</p></div><button type="button" class="close-card" id="closeList" aria-label="关闭 2D 导航并返回全景"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 6 12 12M18 6 6 18"/></svg></button></div>
      <div class="list-grid">
        <a class="list-card" href="/projects/koto/"><div class="list-card-top"><h3>KOTO</h3><span>01 ↗</span></div><p>音视频转录与日语学习工具。<br>把听见的内容，变成学习的起点。</p></a>
        <a class="list-card" href="/blog/"><div class="list-card-top"><h3>Blog</h3><span>02 ↗</span></div><p>Java、Spring、Redis、Git 与数据结构。<br>把走过的路，整理成可以翻阅的笔记。</p></a>
        <a class="list-card" href="/lab/"><div class="list-card-top"><h3>Tech Lab</h3><span>03 ↗</span></div><p>留给 AI、后端、云、数据与安全实验的空间。内容将随真实进展逐步加入。</p></a>
        <a class="list-card" href="/projects/train-libre/"><div class="list-card-top"><h3>Train Libre 中文版</h3><span>04 ↗</span></div><p>训练、饮食与营养记录。<br>了解这款移动应用的中文化项目。</p></a>
        <a class="list-card" href="/about/"><div class="list-card-top"><h3>About / Now</h3><span>05 ↗</span></div><p>关于 Xleia、正在做的项目，以及接下来想探索的新想法。</p></a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <p class="mobile-instruction">点击房间里的编号，或选择一个区域</p>
    <nav class="dock-wrap" aria-label="工作室区域" id="explore">
      <div class="dock-label"><strong>探索工作室</strong>FIVE CORNERS</div>
      <div class="dock">
        <button class="dock-button" type="button" data-zone="koto" aria-pressed="false"><span class="dock-number">01</span><span><span class="dock-name">KOTO</span><span class="dock-subtitle">主工作台</span></span></button>
        <button class="dock-button" type="button" data-zone="blog" aria-pressed="false"><span class="dock-number">02</span><span><span class="dock-name">Blog</span><span class="dock-subtitle">文章书架</span></span></button>
        <button class="dock-button" type="button" data-zone="lab" aria-pressed="false"><span class="dock-number">03</span><span><span class="dock-name">Tech Lab</span><span class="dock-subtitle">实验工作台</span></span></button>
        <button class="dock-button" type="button" data-zone="train" aria-pressed="false"><span class="dock-number">04</span><span><span class="dock-name">Train Libre</span><span class="dock-subtitle">训练与营养</span></span></button>
        <button class="dock-button" type="button" data-zone="about" aria-pressed="false"><span class="dock-number">05</span><span><span class="dock-name">About / Now</span><span class="dock-subtitle">私人角落</span></span></button>
      </div>
    </nav>


    <p class="sr-only" id="sceneStatus" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    <noscript><p class="noscript">交互需要 JavaScript。也可直接打开：<a href="/projects/koto/">KOTO</a><a href="/blog/">Blog</a><a href="/lab/">Lab</a><a href="/projects/train-libre/">Train Libre</a><a href="/about/">About</a></p></noscript>
  </main>
  <script is:inline>
    (() => {
      'use strict';
      const studio = document.getElementById('studio');
      const sceneStage = document.getElementById('sceneStage');
      const world = document.getElementById('world');
      const image = document.getElementById('roomImage');
      const card = document.getElementById('projectCard');
      const cardTitle = document.getElementById('cardTitle');
      const cardKicker = document.getElementById('cardKicker');
      const cardCopy = document.getElementById('cardCopy');
      const cardLink = document.getElementById('cardLink');
      const cardLinkLabel = document.getElementById('cardLinkLabel');
      const listPanel = document.getElementById('listPanel');
      const listToggle = document.getElementById('listToggle');
      const listTitle = document.getElementById('listTitle');
      const status = document.getElementById('sceneStatus');
      const zoneButtons = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('[data-zone]'));
      const mobile = window.matchMedia('(max-width: 720px)');
      const reduceMotion = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)');
      const zones = {
        koto:{name:'KOTO',kicker:'01 / 主工作台 · 日语学习',copy:'音视频转录与日语学习工具。让听见的内容成为学习材料，在真实语境中积累理解。',href:'/projects/koto/',link:'查看 KOTO 项目',x:.508,y:.396,zoom:1.72},
        blog:{name:'Blog',kicker:'02 / 文章书架 · 技术积累',copy:'关于 Java、Spring、Redis、Git 和数据结构的技术笔记。把走过的路整理下来，让下一次探索有迹可循。',href:'/blog/',link:'翻开技术笔记',x:.124,y:.428,zoom:1.62},
        lab:{name:'Tech Lab',kicker:'03 / 实验工作台 · 跨领域探索',copy:'为 AI、后端、云、数据与安全实验留出的位置。实验内容将随真实进展逐步加入。',href:'/lab/',link:'进入实验区',x:.828,y:.475,zoom:1.7},
        train:{name:'Train Libre',kicker:'04 / 中文化项目 · 训练与营养',copy:'面向训练、饮食与营养记录的中文化移动应用。从这里了解项目的方向与中文化工作。',href:'/projects/train-libre/',link:'查看 Train Libre 中文版',x:.884,y:.534,zoom:1.9},
        about:{name:'About / Now',kicker:'05 / 私人角落 · 关于 Xleia',copy:'在工作之外，留一个慢下来的角落。关于 Xleia、正在做的项目，以及接下来值得探索的新想法。',href:'/about/',link:'认识 Xleia',x:.906,y:.745,zoom:1.52}
      };
      let workbench = null;
      let drag = null;
      function depthUnavailable() {
        workbench = null;
        studio.classList.remove('has-depth');
        document.querySelector('.hint').textContent = '点击聚焦 · Esc 返回';
        document.querySelector('.mobile-instruction').textContent = '点击房间里的编号，或选择一个区域';
        layout();
      }
      let selected = null;
      let lastTrigger = null;
      const clamp = (value,min,max) => Math.max(min,Math.min(max,value));

      function layout() {
        const bounds = (mobile.matches ? sceneStage : studio).getBoundingClientRect();
        const aspect = image.naturalWidth && image.naturalHeight ? image.naturalWidth / image.naturalHeight : 1672 / 941;
        const width = Math.max(bounds.width,bounds.height * aspect);
        const height = width / aspect;
        const zone = selected && zones[selected];
        const scale = zone && !workbench ? (mobile.matches ? Math.min(zone.zoom,1.5) : zone.zoom) : 1;
        let x = (bounds.width-width) / 2;
        let y = (bounds.height-height) / 2;
        if (zone && !workbench) {
          x = clamp(bounds.width * .5-zone.x * width * scale,bounds.width-width * scale,0);
          y = clamp(bounds.height * (mobile.matches ? .5 : .42)-zone.y * height * scale,bounds.height-height * scale,0);
        }
        world.style.width = width + 'px';
        world.style.height = height + 'px';
        world.style.transform = `translate(${x}px,${y}px) scale(${scale})`;
        world.style.setProperty('--inverse',String(1/scale));
      }

      function updateButtons() {
        zoneButtons.forEach(button => {
          const active = button.dataset.zone === selected;
          button.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(active));
          // Hidden hotspots are removed from keyboard navigation while a card is open.
          if (button.classList.contains('pin')) button.tabIndex = (listPanel.hidden && (!selected || active)) ? 0 : -1;
        });
      }

      function focusZone(id,trigger) {
        const zone = zones[id];
        if (!zone) return;
        highlight(null);
        lastTrigger = trigger;
        selected = id;
        studio.dataset.zone = id;
        listPanel.hidden = true;
        listToggle.setAttribute('aria-pressed','false');
        document.getElementById('listToggleLabel').textContent = '2D 导航';
        studio.classList.remove('is-list');
        studio.classList.add('is-focused');
        cardKicker.textContent = zone.kicker;
        cardTitle.textContent = zone.name;
        cardCopy.textContent = zone.copy;
        cardLink.href = zone.href;
        cardLinkLabel.textContent = zone.link;
        card.hidden = true;
        function showCard() {
          if (selected !== id) return;
          card.hidden = false;
          cardTitle.focus({preventScroll:true});
          status.textContent = '已聚焦 ' + zone.name + '。项目介绍已展开，可按 Escape 返回全景。';
        }
        if (workbench) workbench.focus(id,showCard);
        else showCard();
        updateButtons();
        layout();
        if (mobile.matches && trigger.classList.contains('dock-button')) {
          sceneStage.scrollIntoView({behavior:reduceMotion.matches ? 'auto' : 'smooth',block:'start'});
        }
      }

      function reset(restoreFocus = false) {
        selected = null;
        delete studio.dataset.zone;
        workbench?.reset();
        card.hidden = true;
        listPanel.hidden = true;
        studio.classList.remove('is-focused','is-list');
        listToggle.setAttribute('aria-pressed','false');
        document.getElementById('listToggleLabel').textContent = '2D 导航';
        updateButtons();
        layout();
        status.textContent = '已返回工作室全景。';
        if (restoreFocus && lastTrigger && document.contains(lastTrigger)) lastTrigger.focus({preventScroll:true});
      }

      function openList() {
        if (!listPanel.hidden) { reset(false); listToggle.focus({preventScroll:true}); return; }
        reset(false);
        highlight(null);
        lastTrigger = listToggle;
        listPanel.hidden = false;
        studio.classList.add('is-list');
        listToggle.setAttribute('aria-pressed','true');
        document.getElementById('listToggleLabel').textContent = '返回全景';
        updateButtons();
        listTitle.focus({preventScroll:true});
        status.textContent = '2D 导航已打开。';
        if (mobile.matches) listPanel.scrollIntoView({behavior:reduceMotion.matches ? 'auto' : 'smooth',block:'start'});
      }

      const canvas = document.getElementById('depthView');
      import('/studio/workbench/scene.js').then(async ({mountWorkbench}) => {
        const view = await mountWorkbench(canvas, Array.from(world.querySelectorAll('.pin')), depthUnavailable);
        if (!view) return;
        workbench = view;
        studio.classList.add('has-depth');
        document.querySelector('.hint').textContent = '左右拖动环顾 · 点击物件聚焦 · Esc 返回';
        document.querySelector('.mobile-instruction').textContent = '左右轻扫环顾房间，轻点物件或编号进入';
        if (selected) workbench.focus(selected,() => {});
        layout();
      }).catch(depthUnavailable);

      function objectAt(event) {
        const bounds = world.getBoundingClientRect();
        return workbench?.pick((event.clientX-bounds.left)/bounds.width,(event.clientY-bounds.top)/bounds.height);
      }
      let hovered = null;
      function highlight(pin) {
        if (pin === hovered) return;
        hovered?.classList.remove('object-hover');
        hovered = pin;
        hovered?.classList.add('object-hover');
        world.style.cursor = pin ? 'pointer' : '';
      }
      sceneStage.addEventListener('pointerleave', () => highlight(null));
      sceneStage.addEventListener('pointerdown', event => {
        if (!workbench || selected || !listPanel.hidden || !event.isPrimary || event.button !== 0 || event.target.closest('button')) return;
        drag = {id:event.pointerId,start:event.clientX,top:event.clientY,moved:false};
        highlight(null);
        sceneStage.setPointerCapture(event.pointerId);
        studio.classList.add('is-dragging');
      });
      sceneStage.addEventListener('pointermove', event => {
        if (!workbench || selected || !listPanel.hidden) return;
        if (!drag) {
          if (event.pointerType !== 'touch') highlight(objectAt(event));
          return;
        }
        if (drag.id !== event.pointerId) return;
        if (Math.hypot(event.clientX-drag.start,event.clientY-drag.top)>6) drag.moved=true;
        if (!drag.moved) return;
        workbench.pan((event.clientX-drag.start) / (sceneStage.clientWidth*.28));
      });
      function endDrag(event) {
        if (drag?.id !== event.pointerId) return;
        const pin = event.type === 'pointerup' && !drag.moved && !selected && listPanel.hidden ? objectAt(event) : null;
        drag = null;
        studio.classList.remove('is-dragging');
        if (pin) { focusZone(pin.dataset.zone,pin); return; }
        if (!selected) workbench?.reset();
      }
      sceneStage.addEventListener('pointerup',endDrag);
      sceneStage.addEventListener('pointercancel',endDrag);
      sceneStage.addEventListener('lostpointercapture',endDrag);
      zoneButtons.forEach(button => button.addEventListener('click',() => focusZone(button.dataset.zone,button)));
      document.getElementById('resetView').addEventListener('click',() => reset(false));
      document.getElementById('closeCard').addEventListener('click',() => reset(true));
      document.getElementById('closeList').addEventListener('click',() => { reset(false); listToggle.focus({preventScroll:true}); });
      listToggle.addEventListener('click',openList);
      document.addEventListener('keydown',event => {
        if (event.key === 'Escape' && (selected || !listPanel.hidden)) { event.preventDefault(); reset(true); }
      });
      image.addEventListener('load',layout);
      image.addEventListener('error',() => { document.getElementById('imageError').hidden = false; });
      if (image.complete && !image.naturalWidth) document.getElementById('imageError').hidden = false;
      const observer = new ResizeObserver(layout);
      observer.observe(studio);
      observer.observe(sceneStage);
      mobile.addEventListener('change',layout);
      layout();
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
